             ("What causes uneven skin tone?", "The most common causes in Indian skin are sun and tan, dark marks left after pimples, friction from clothes or rubbing, hormonal changes such as melasma, and dryness that makes skin look dull and patchy. Finding your main cause matters, because sunscreen, gentle care or a doctor's advice may be the real fix.", ''),
